                {
                    "message": "Some say that this well is encahnted.\nA coin for a wish.\nI don't believe it though.\n"
                },

                {
                    "message": "This well is a curse on the town. People come and throw coins expecting riches.\nIt's all a mess!\n"
                },

                {
                    "message": "Those Blackthane's are nothing but trouble and a messy bunch.\nI swear the younger brother makes cursed weapons at night!"
                },


                {
                    "message": "If you visit my sister, clean her shop for her.\nHer unorganized mess is a stain on the Oakheart name."
                },

                {
                    "message": "My family came here to learn about the magic of the woods.\nI prefer crafting the best potions instead of adventure."
                },

                {
                    "message": "The Oakhearts and Blackthanes are the two dominate families of this village.\nMy family, the Oakhearts, are the better of the two!"
